  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. Amazon CloudWatch Observability Admin adds the ability to audit telemetry configuration for AWS resources in customers AWS Accounts and Organizations. The release introduces new APIs to turn on/off the new experience, which supports discovering supported AWS resources and their state of telemetry.",
